; ATC_MACRO_ID_HANDFETCH    392 //manual tool fetch (raise Z, go to G30, pause for operator to install tool)
;
; Called after the outgoing tool has been returned (if applicable).
; Pauses for the operator to install the incoming hand-loaded tool.
; In a combined hand→hand swap, P393 has already notified the operator to remove
; the outgoing tool — this pause covers the install of the incoming tool.
;
; Parameters:
;   #4902 = incoming tool number

; ── Move to manual change position (G30) ─────────────────────────────────────
G53 G0 Z0
G53 G0 X#5181                               ; G30 X only — Y unchanged

; ── Notify operator ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
(print, ATC: install tool #4902 and press cycle start)
M0
M99
